Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): expose Explain G-code in post options

Add the shared undoable checkbox and longer-program notice.
Pin document and setup routing, accessibility, and MCP Explain overrides.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1390
